      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dypaca/{size}/2079_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-03-26T05:05:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Shuffle the trash the moment you draw, discard, or play a card from an empty deck.&nbsp; The deck can stay empty for awhile so long as you aren't required to do one of those things.</p><p>If you&nbsp;need to discard 5 cards from a deck with 3 cards in it, discard 3 then shuffle and discard 2 more.</p>",
