      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Okay, semi-related: if a card says &quot;reveal cards until you reveal (blah blah)&quot; and you get through the deck without reveal any of whatever, do you shuffle and keep revealing? Or cancel the effect?</p>",
