      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Well you don&#39;t cancel the effect entirely.&nbsp; If you reveal some but not all of the cards it was searching for, you do apply the effect to them.&nbsp; But just revealing cards does not cause you to shuffle the discard.</p><p>Basically when you are told to reveal cards (either a certain number or until you reveal something), you should act like it also says &quot;or until you reveal the entire deck&quot;.</p>",
