      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/benhimself/{size}/2160_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-03-26T06:21:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Interesting. So trashing cards from your deck invokes shuffling if you can't finish, but revealing doesn't? I suppose it would be easy to get stuck in a situation where you're revealing until you find something and it's not actually in the deck or trash (because it's in play or hand or whatnot.)</p>",
