      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Interesting. So trashing cards from your deck invokes shuffling if you can&#39;t finish, but revealing doesn&#39;t? I suppose it would be easy to get stuck in a situation where you&#39;re revealing until you find something and it&#39;s not actually in the deck or trash (because it&#39;s in play or hand or whatnot.)</p>",
